# Project Title: Calculator

## Description

This code is used to help the user calculate a set of numbers using the DMAS (Divide, Multiply, Add, Subtract) Operationsa and display the final result.

### Dependencies

Optional: ASCII_Art.py - this script has the logo for the Calculator. Not mandatory, but adds a little bit of flavour to the mix.

### Installations Needed

NA

